{"id":"vod_md_4584","vodId":"4584","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"向山进发","name_cn":"向山进发","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230910-1/136252ab84a9b72f7016be4cf9166b52.jpg"},"summary":"刚刚升入高中的雪村葵（井口裕香 配音）是一个性格内向到有些古怪的女孩子，她不擅长与人交际，更乐于独自一人宅在家中尝试各种有趣事物，即使被同学疏远也全不介意。童年的她曾经热衷爬山，但在一次攀登公园器材时摔成了骨折，从此罹患恐高症。开学第一天，小葵便与小学时代的朋友日向（阿澄佳奈 配音）重逢。当年两个小家伙曾共同爬上山顶，见识了壮美的自然风光，更相约日后再攀高峰。小葵早已忘掉当初的誓言，但乐观开朗的日向却记着彼此的约定。看来小葵真到了走出家门，回归大自然怀抱的时候了……本片根据日本插画家Shiro（しろ）的同名原著改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-10 07:40:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/U6sWMcXb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/2p0LNb0q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/8E51gjZH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/IVBcYoIN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/H24xyLpI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/QiuoU6oI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/UEvo8RLm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/HPOoYND3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/nGPUrXgZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/BxPghOQg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/GdmIaF9o/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/tB84HF0m/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:37.338Z"}